  "common_gotchas": [
    "Source normals matter because they define initial particle velocity when normal-based emission is enabled.",
    "The time increment should stay at or below one over the project frame rate for predictable stepping.",
    "The id attribute created by doid appears only after reset or first load, so downstream id logic needs an initialized sim.",
    "Wind is velocity-sensitive and differs from a plain external force."
  ],
